Citation
--------
    Fani, A., Doan, M., Le, I., Fedorov, A., Hoffmann, M., Rorden, C., Plis, S. MindGrab for
    BrainChop: Fast and Accurate Skull Stripping for Command Line and Browser.
    arXiv:2506.11860 (2025). https://arxiv.org/abs/2506.11860

    Fedorov, A., et al. End-to-end learning of brain tissue segmentation from imperfect
    labeling. IJCNN 2017 (the MeshNet architecture).

Intended use
------------
`-mindgrab` is automated research segmentation. It is not a medical device and carries no
diagnostic guarantee. Inspect its output before relying on it.
